"若使用本地异构部署，可在 `python/aibrix/aibrix/gpu_optimizer/optimizer/profiling/result/ "
"<https://github.com/vllm-project/aibrix/tree/main/python/aibrix/aibrix/gpu_optimizer/optimizer/profiling/result/>`_ "
